[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195861789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109690#issuecomment-3195861789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109690","id":3195861789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-fPsd","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T09:21:17Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T09:21:17Z","body":"I'd say this is to be expected and is desirable, just because you deleted the file that doesn't mean you intended to remove the plugin, that could be by mistake, so the warning gives you that heads up. If the plugin was not removed properly it should warn IMO","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195861789/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196111688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109690#issuecomment-3196111688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109690","id":3196111688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-gMtI","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T10:36:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T10:36:04Z","body":"If the message doesn't reappear after restarting the editor, I don't think we should consider it a bug. It's just a warning that you've deleted a plugin in an unintended way (there was an entry in the Project Settings about an activated plugin that no longer exists). It's assumed that you'll first disable the plugin before deleting its files (plugins have a callback about being disabled and can perform some actions before deactivation).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196111688/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196115291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109690#issuecomment-3196115291","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109690","id":3196115291,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-gNlb","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T10:37:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T10:37:25Z","body":"> If the message doesn't reappear after restarting the editor, I don't think we should consider it a bug. It's just a warning that you've deleted a plugin in an unintended way (there was an entry in the Project Settings about an activated plugin that no longer exists). It's assumed that you'll first disable the plugin before deleting its files (plugins have a callback about being disabled and can perform some actions before deactivation).\n\nAnd what am I saying? It appeared every time after restarting. And I couldn’t disable it because it was deleted, but the flag remained.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196115291/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196135861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109690#issuecomment-3196135861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109690","id":3196135861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-gSm1","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T10:44:35Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T10:44:35Z","body":"> It appeared every time after restarting.\n\nThis shouldn't happen. At least the message is worded as if the entry for the non-existent plugin is deleted after this check (\"Removing from enabled plugins.\"). There might be a bug.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0c51ede2434d99d2c80dc87b7df179db66537f1c/editor/editor_node.cpp#L4021-L4025\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0c51ede2434d99d2c80dc87b7df179db66537f1c/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1117-L1127","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196135861/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196779537","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109690#issuecomment-3196779537","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109690","id":3196779537,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-ivwR","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T13:10:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T13:10:28Z","body":"> This shouldn't happen. At least the message is worded as if the entry for the non-existent plugin is deleted after this check (\"Removing from enabled plugins.\"). There might be a bug.\n\nI thought the same when I just deleted an unnecessary plugin, but it turned out that it simply doesn’t remove its active flag. It really seems like a minor bug.\n\nI recorded a more detailed video to further demonstrate this - https://youtu.be/Hz8HV4I5Fgs (also, as I mentioned, it doesn’t matter whether you delete it in the project tree or, as I did in the video, through the file manager).\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196779537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3757571966","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109690#issuecomment-3757571966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109690","id":3757571966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f9_9-","user":{"login":"Maaack","id":788630,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODYzMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/788630?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack","html_url":"https://github.com/Maaack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maaack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T00:57:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T00:57:20Z","body":"Getting the same issue on every restart of one of my projects, in Godot 4.5.1.\nSince the warning literally says, \"Removing from enabled plugins.\" then I would expect `project.godot` to be updated to have the plugin removed. That does not happen. Even force saving the current scene doesn't apply any change to `project.godot`.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3757571966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]